<title>GREECE: Greek fund managers' market shares end-Nov.</title>
<headline>Greek fund managers' market shares end-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's mutual fund industry numbered 150 funds with assets under management of 3.72 trillion drachmas and 30 fund management companies, the Union of Institutional Investors said in its monthly review.</p>
